{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0253C0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"“和平对人类关系而言是一种不自然的状态”……是这么说的吗？你说是在学校里学到的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":"JPN_WORDING_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。是德国哲学家康德说的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"这句话写在他1795年的《永久和平论》里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":55,"review_flag":"TITLE_RENDERED_FROM_JPN"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"但康德主张，正因如此，人们才必须创造和平。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"怎么做？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"那本书里就写着。Snake也开始对和平感兴趣了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":62,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"不……我是活在与和平完全相反的世界里的人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":"AUX_LOCALIZATION_DEVIATION_JPN_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"这样啊……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"……我的祖父母死于内战。如果是和平年代，他们本不该死的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":"AUX_OMISSION_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"你希望发生战争吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"我并不想伤害无辜的平民。但如果遭到其他国家攻击，该怎么办？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":"JPN_OTHER_COUNTRY_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"为了防止侵略、镇压和不当的政治支配，国家需要有保护自己的力量。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"JPN_CAUSAL_STRUCTURE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"如果所有国家都停止侵略，也不再用武力干涉他国内政，就不再需要自卫的力量了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":"JPN_INTERNAL_AFFAIRS_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"要怎么让他们保证做到这一点？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"这个……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":"NO_MLG_CN_JPN_TRANSLATED"},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"……抱歉。但为了保护自己和家人，也有必要认清现实。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"JPN_SELF_AND_FAMILY_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"当然，我也认为拥有理想很重要。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"是啊……谢谢。Peace！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":29,"review_flag":"AUX_ADDITION_REMOVED_PER_JPN"}]}